00:08.170 --> 00:11.760
<i>That sounds more like a criticism than a compliment…</i>

00:12.380 --> 00:17.100
<i>It's nothing, the crazy fawn disrupted my routine,</i>

00:17.600 --> 00:20.300
<i>but calm mornings suit me better.</i>

00:20.520 --> 00:22.770
<i>The president must set an example.</i>

