​​​ ​Mo shika shite unmei no mama ma iku​ ​​

01:44.480 --> 01:47.280
​​​ ​Just like that, going along with fate​ ​​

01:47.280 --> 01:49.720
​​​ ​Kokoro no doko ka de koshitantan​ ​​

