​​​ ​With you, forever​ ​​

01:52.520 --> 01:57.690
​​​ ​Shika noko noko noko koshi tan tan​ ​​

01:59.030 --> 02:04.040
In search of her weakness

02:06.200 --> 02:08.710
- Good morning!
- Why are you here so early?

02:08.900 --> 02:11.170
You're always here at the last minute!

02:11.450 --> 02:14.630
I rolled over in my sleep and ended up here.

02:14.840 --> 02:15.960
You rolled over?

02:16.260 --> 02:17.550
<i>Yes, like this.</i>

02:18.300 --> 02:19.300
This sucks,

02:19.470 --> 02:23.430
the Hino beast can't afford to be attacked from behind.

02:23.640 --> 02:26.390
I used to fight for my life.

02:26.640 --> 02:29.640
Same for me, you know!

02:31.810 --> 02:34.020
Hunters' club

03:00.470 --> 03:01.550
<i>Good luck!</i>

03:07.970 --> 03:10.440
Big liar! Like, you're on the run!

03:10.940 --> 03:12.950
The letter in your locker

03:14.060 --> 03:15.720
is it a love letter?

03:16.020 --> 03:17.690
A… What?

03:20.230 --> 03:22.030
Is it your first?

03:22.070 --> 03:23.490
So what?

03:23.660 --> 03:25.870
When you're as pretty as me,

03:26.030 --> 03:28.580
not many people dare approach you.

03:28.880 --> 03:32.250
I knew I'd get one eventually.

03:33.750 --> 03:35.000
Are you judging me?

03:35.320 --> 03:38.260
Have you ever gotten one?

03:38.840 --> 03:40.550
- No!
- Are you serious?

03:41.010 --> 03:44.340
Then why are you looking down on me?

03:44.680 --> 03:45.600
It's simple.

03:46.350 --> 03:48.930
There's one in my locker.

03:50.500 --> 03:52.490
I can feel its presence.

03:54.560 --> 03:56.360
My antlers tell me.

03:56.690 --> 03:58.610
<i>I find that hard to believe…</i>

03:59.460 --> 04:00.000
<i>But…</i>

04:00.570 --> 04:02.900
<i>maybe it caught someone's eye…</i>

04:03.280 --> 04:05.950
Open sesame!

04:07.700 --> 04:08.410
There's nothing.

04:09.660 --> 04:11.790
<i>She's super shocked!</i>

04:12.120 --> 04:14.460
Don't let it get you down.

04:14.620 --> 04:18.040
It's a matter of luck and timing…

04:20.720 --> 04:24.670
It's okay! The anime studio and the manga publisher

04:24.810 --> 04:28.350
must be flooded with fan letters for me!

04:28.980 --> 04:29.930
Excuse me?

04:30.140 --> 04:32.090
<i>Don't hesitate to write to us.</i>

04:32.810 --> 04:36.400
So? Are you going to date the sender?

04:37.240 --> 04:37.980
What?

04:38.360 --> 04:41.320
We don't even know if it's a love letter…

04:41.620 --> 04:44.630
Plus, I don't know, you're catching me off guard…

04:44.900 --> 04:47.030
It's terrible to be so cruel!

04:47.840 --> 04:49.850
So you've decided to run away?

04:50.080 --> 04:52.580
What about the sender's feelings?

04:52.870 --> 04:55.670
You owe them a proper response!

04:56.040 --> 04:57.580
You've got a point!

04:59.130 --> 05:02.260
Take your time to figure out what you want.

05:02.590 --> 05:06.510
And if you feel something for this person, then…

05:07.180 --> 05:09.930
Live that love for me too…

05:10.470 --> 05:11.640
Shikanoko…

05:12.350 --> 05:13.430
You're right.

05:13.640 --> 05:15.980
This person was honest.

05:16.390 --> 05:17.980
They deserve my attention.

05:18.440 --> 05:19.400
Of course.

05:19.900 --> 05:21.650
<i>I challenge you!</i>

05:21.820 --> 05:23.740
Damn it!

05:27.160 --> 05:28.370
Say something!

05:28.870 --> 05:31.440
Okay, I'll crush them!

05:31.660 --> 05:35.560
I didn't really believe this love letter story!

05:37.000 --> 05:39.000
But speak, already!

05:42.670 --> 05:45.880
Finally, the Hino beast!

05:46.350 --> 05:48.970
You managed to get up? Kudos.

05:49.320 --> 05:52.430
My letter made your heart jump, admit it!

05:53.960 --> 05:57.200
Your pet looks pathetic, sweetheart.

05:57.520 --> 05:58.270
My what?

06:00.740 --> 06:03.930
She's talking about you! Why did you come?

06:04.420 --> 06:05.440
It doesn't matter.

06:05.700 --> 06:10.410
I'm going to beat you up and become the strongest girl in Hino.

06:10.700 --> 06:14.200
Sorry, I've reformed.

06:14.520 --> 06:17.470
But it would bother me if you kept bothering me.

06:18.080 --> 06:19.550
So let's get this over with!

06:22.030 --> 06:24.550
Why are you getting ready to hit?

06:25.010 --> 06:27.420
I help my sisters in the club!

06:27.720 --> 06:28.380
Go!

06:28.550 --> 06:29.680
Get lost!

06:30.220 --> 06:32.730
Koshi-tan, have you forgotten who I am?

06:34.280 --> 06:36.430
I'm a deer-human hybrid.

06:37.160 --> 06:40.040
Of all the primates, I'm the strongest…

06:41.070 --> 06:41.680
of the deer.

06:42.040 --> 06:43.810
You look fragile, especially!

06:44.160 --> 06:47.570
<i>Face Yoshida Saori, and we'll talk.</i>

06:49.120 --> 06:52.070
Enough nonsense, attack!

07:04.740 --> 07:06.580
Got you!

07:16.210 --> 07:18.310
<i>Three against one with weapons?</i>

07:18.520 --> 07:20.620
<i>I'll struggle, barehanded!</i>

07:23.920 --> 07:25.540
Koshi-tan! Use this!

07:28.800 --> 07:31.400
Your thing is useless!

07:55.000 --> 07:58.090
You blew up the gym? Nice move for a delinquent!

07:58.340 --> 08:01.170
It's your fault! And you're taking the hit too!

08:02.770 --> 08:04.650
EXPLOSION AT SCHOOL — NO INJURIES

08:05.110 --> 08:07.480
Good thing it's a comedy…

08:07.650 --> 08:10.650
Niigata prefecture, Mount Yahiko
Panorama tower

08:14.450 --> 08:16.240
<i>Since she arrived,</i>

08:17.250 --> 08:19.560
<i>she's been driving me crazy.</i>

08:20.760 --> 08:22.810
<i>We even ended up in the news.</i>

08:23.250 --> 08:25.110
<i>I absolutely must discover</i>

08:25.760 --> 08:26.970
<i>her weak point!</i>

08:28.090 --> 08:32.930
<i>I decided to follow her one evening when we didn't have club activities,</i>

08:33.510 --> 08:34.840
<i>but she does nothing.</i>

08:36.140 --> 08:38.560
<i>She's been sitting there for an hour.</i>

08:39.270 --> 08:41.390
<i>Is she waiting for someone? Just hanging around?</i>

08:41.720 --> 08:42.730
<i>I don't get it…</i>

08:44.070 --> 08:45.100
<i>Could it be</i>

08:45.730 --> 08:47.810
<i>that she has no home?</i>

08:53.900 --> 08:55.820
I'm so hungry…

08:56.350 --> 09:00.290
<i>Did I guess right? She has no roof, no money, no food?</i>

09:01.320 --> 09:02.800
It's snack time.

09:03.850 --> 09:07.580
<i>She's forced to eat her hard, tasteless antlers?</i>

09:07.990 --> 09:09.690
<i>It breaks my heart…</i>

09:10.250 --> 09:12.730
<i>Oh well, I'll buy her dinner.</i>

09:17.460 --> 09:17.840
Yum!

09:18.010 --> 09:20.130
<i>- Nonsense!
- No, banana.</i>

09:21.460 --> 09:22.650
<i>Calm down…</i>

09:22.850 --> 09:24.850
<i>My tailing just started.</i>

09:25.360 --> 09:26.710
<i>A little patience.</i>

09:27.080 --> 09:27.950
I have nothing left.

09:28.380 --> 09:30.270
<i>I will find her weakness!</i>

09:31.300 --> 09:32.700
It's time to go!

09:36.350 --> 09:37.200
<i>Is she going home?</i>

09:37.480 --> 09:40.700
<i>Yes, she must have a home after all…</i>

09:43.790 --> 09:45.540
HINO ZOO

09:51.490 --> 09:53.250
Good morning, Tsunoda-san!

09:53.420 --> 09:54.260
Good morning.

09:56.720 --> 10:01.850
DEER

09:56.920 --> 09:59.010
<i>Wait, she lives here?</i>

09:59.270 --> 10:01.830
<i>Rooming with Tsunoda? Wait…</i>

10:02.390 --> 10:04.270
<i>A human penned up with deer?</i>

10:04.430 --> 10:06.100
<i>She's in an enclosure!</i>

10:06.380 --> 10:10.120
<i>What's the idea? Are they drunk at the Hino Zoo?</i>

10:10.940 --> 10:12.610
Oh, deer!

10:13.210 --> 10:14.210
So cute!

10:14.700 --> 10:16.410
Welcome to the Hino Zoo!

10:16.570 --> 10:17.500
She talks!

10:17.530 --> 10:18.770
How clever!

10:18.940 --> 10:20.720
<i>They're chatting calmly?</i>

10:21.990 --> 10:23.990
Here is the deer enclosure!

10:24.200 --> 10:25.620
<i>She even stood up!</i>

10:25.950 --> 10:26.790
He stood up!

10:26.890 --> 10:28.320
So cool!

10:28.530 --> 10:29.930
<i>Aren't they shocked?</i>

10:30.170 --> 10:31.960
<i>Her image of the deer is collapsing.</i>

10:32.170 --> 10:35.300
You can feed us by the deer cracker.

10:35.820 --> 10:37.150
I want to try!

10:37.280 --> 10:38.220
Let's go!

10:38.510 --> 10:39.930
300 yen per person.

10:39.980 --> 10:41.800
<i>Why are you the one taking the money?</i>

10:44.220 --> 10:44.680
Here you go.

10:46.400 --> 10:48.640
I've never seen these crackers before!

10:48.790 --> 10:50.650
Which one should I feed?

10:51.780 --> 10:53.020
This little fawn?

10:53.590 --> 10:56.330
Come on! I've got a deer cracker for you!

10:56.740 --> 10:57.280
Here!

11:01.510 --> 11:03.990
This deer is crazy! Let go of me!

11:04.030 --> 11:05.790
Two bananas aren't enough.

11:06.160 --> 11:09.460
<i>She's eating the crackers she sells?</i>

11:09.750 --> 11:12.750
<i>The mystery deepens…</i>

11:14.710 --> 11:17.840
<i>No one's shocked she's in the enclosure?</i>

11:18.000 --> 11:19.580
<i>Am I the only one, seriously?</i>

11:20.510 --> 11:21.930
That was horrible!

11:22.630 --> 11:25.340
<i>Our famous Lord of the Deer parade</i>

11:25.700 --> 11:27.880
<i>will begin shortly.</i>

11:28.280 --> 11:30.240
<i>Please stand along the path.</i>

11:30.310 --> 11:32.060
The Lord of the Deer?

11:40.790 --> 11:42.140
They're carrying her?

11:42.360 --> 11:43.660
What's going on?

11:43.820 --> 11:47.040
Little animals usually do this!

11:47.450 --> 11:50.910
What majestic and lovely antlers!

11:51.370 --> 11:53.830
They've opened their hearts to us.

11:54.190 --> 11:55.020
Who are you?

11:55.370 --> 11:56.550
Watch.

11:58.590 --> 11:59.670
What now?

12:04.660 --> 12:06.220
A magic trick?

12:07.750 --> 12:09.120
They're all into it!

12:09.670 --> 12:12.850
The deer-girl is wearing a sailor uniform!

12:13.160 --> 12:14.500
The what?

12:14.710 --> 12:17.640
It's like she's walking on a plain of deer.

12:17.950 --> 12:19.530
A what?

12:20.010 --> 12:25.030
A girl dressed in a sailor uniform will descend on a field of deer.

12:25.730 --> 12:28.230
The legend was true!

12:28.640 --> 12:31.010
I've never heard of that!

12:31.450 --> 12:32.970
Oh? It's Koshi-tan!

12:34.000 --> 12:35.830
What are you doing here?

12:36.890 --> 12:38.300
Your clothes so weird!

12:39.470 --> 12:42.630
I'm wandering around, I had some free time.

12:42.890 --> 12:45.400
And I felt like going to the zoo, that's all!

12:47.230 --> 12:48.050
What?

12:48.680 --> 12:50.740
Don't tell me…

12:51.820 --> 12:53.480
you're one of my fans?

12:53.740 --> 12:54.640
Don't push it.

12:55.230 --> 12:59.570
<i>Thank you for visiting Hino zoo.</i>

13:00.070 --> 13:03.520
<i>We close the gates at 5 PM.</i>

13:03.780 --> 13:06.910
<i>We hope to see you again very soon.</i>

13:07.190 --> 13:08.420
Goodbye to all!

13:08.870 --> 13:11.950
This job is exhausting!

13:12.230 --> 13:12.750
This job?

13:13.760 --> 13:15.750
<i>So she doesn't live here?</i>

13:17.560 --> 13:20.630
I deserve a bubble tea as a reward!

13:20.960 --> 13:22.430
Do you have money?

13:22.970 --> 13:24.090
Huh? Of course.

13:26.340 --> 13:28.220
Wow, all those wads of cash!

13:28.550 --> 13:31.310
Why were you hanging out in a park then?

13:31.610 --> 13:33.140
Are you mad?

13:33.370 --> 13:34.680
Not at all!

13:34.920 --> 13:35.730
Say…

13:36.330 --> 13:38.060
Do you want to get a bubble tea?

13:38.980 --> 13:40.730
You can dream on!

13:46.360 --> 13:46.940
Wow!

13:47.090 --> 13:48.170
The deer…

13:48.680 --> 13:51.820
Did you see? It's good, right?

13:54.810 --> 13:55.550
Wow!

13:55.710 --> 13:56.750
The deer…

14:02.970 --> 14:07.840
<i>Because of this typical teenage outing experience…</i>

14:08.630 --> 14:10.030
See you tomorrow!

14:11.170 --> 14:11.930
Sure!

14:14.300 --> 14:17.010
<i>Koshi-tan forgot her tailing</i>

14:17.220 --> 14:19.520
<i>and went home smiling.</i>

14:19.920 --> 14:21.990
<i>Still as simple-minded as ever.</i>

14:22.570 --> 14:26.070
Niigata prefecture
Yahiko-Jinja shrine
Deer garden

14:26.070 --> 14:29.570
Mount Yahiko, Yahiko-Jinja shrine
Niigata prefecture

14:29.570 --> 14:32.580
Deer club

14:33.170 --> 14:35.600
<i>Nekoyamada Neko, the vice-president of the student council.</i>

14:35.880 --> 14:37.910
<i>She is 132cm tall.</i>

14:38.470 --> 14:42.490
<i>She is plotting to oust Koshi-tan and shut down the deer club.</i>

14:43.210 --> 14:46.350
Pres isn't here, she's meeting with Ms. Ukai.

14:46.630 --> 14:47.670
This is my chance.

14:48.580 --> 14:52.650
If I want to steal her position as president and school idol,

14:52.840 --> 14:54.310
I have to find it!

14:54.790 --> 14:56.350
Pres' weak point!

14:59.140 --> 14:59.700
Hi.

15:03.590 --> 15:06.110
You scared me! Why did you do that?

15:06.480 --> 15:10.300
I should be asking you! What were you doing there?

15:12.000 --> 15:13.640
Well, uh…

15:14.030 --> 15:14.870
What?

15:15.490 --> 15:16.580
Do you…

15:17.720 --> 15:18.710
…want to join?

15:21.170 --> 15:22.000
No…

15:22.170 --> 15:26.420
You should have told me earlier! I'm coming right away!

15:27.210 --> 15:28.550
I need to get out of here…

15:28.720 --> 15:29.760
Here I am!

15:30.880 --> 15:36.930
WELCOME TO THE DEER CLUB

15:31.320 --> 15:32.720
Welcome to the deer club!

15:34.070 --> 15:36.930
<i>She looks super hyped!</i>

15:39.030 --> 15:43.190
I'm glad to see you're interested in us!

15:43.530 --> 15:44.570
Why, by the way?

15:45.110 --> 15:47.910
Do you feel we're entering the deer era?

15:48.310 --> 15:51.300
Do you admire us? We are pretty cool!

15:51.740 --> 15:53.620
What do you like? Our antlers?

15:54.150 --> 15:55.480
Do you want a deer cracker?

15:57.060 --> 15:58.230
You're not even close!

16:01.330 --> 16:03.070
Huh? Where did I go wrong?

16:04.080 --> 16:06.730
I don't want to join your club…

16:07.320 --> 16:11.170
I was just passing by, that's all…

16:11.530 --> 16:14.760
So sorry, but I don't want to join the club…

16:18.250 --> 16:22.360
I see… I got ahead of myself, huh?

16:22.840 --> 16:24.650
<i>She's taking it hard!</i>

16:25.420 --> 16:29.370
Sorry, we don't get many requests, so I got excited…

16:30.180 --> 16:34.030
I was so hyped, I even got out a costume…

16:34.570 --> 16:36.740
You can laugh, go ahead!

16:37.960 --> 16:39.530
<i>I'm starting to feel guilty…</i>

16:40.560 --> 16:41.330
No way!

16:41.900 --> 16:45.050
Since I'm here, could you show me the club?

16:45.500 --> 16:48.900
<i>That way, I can gather information about the president.</i>

16:49.960 --> 16:50.710
Really?

16:51.210 --> 16:53.900
<i>She seems naive, the perfect pawn!</i>

16:54.610 --> 16:55.790
Let me introduce myself!

16:57.010 --> 16:59.850
My name is Shikanoko Noko. Call me Nokotan!

17:00.550 --> 17:02.630
Nekoyamada Neko, 3rd grade.

17:03.480 --> 17:05.230
Nice to meet you, Shikayamada!

17:05.430 --> 17:07.400
Don't turn me into a deer!

17:08.010 --> 17:10.560
<i>Otherwise, she'd be Shikayamada Shika.</i>

17:11.450 --> 17:12.170
Come on!

17:12.450 --> 17:15.130
It's time for ex-deer-cises!

17:15.560 --> 17:18.710
You're going to do them with us, Shikayamada!

17:19.370 --> 17:20.530
<i>Ex-deer-cises?</i>

17:20.870 --> 17:23.500
<i>She accepted the name change.</i>

17:24.180 --> 17:26.810
I'll first introduce you to the others.

17:27.370 --> 17:29.400
Here's the 2nd deer of the club,

17:29.910 --> 17:30.590
Bashame!

17:30.900 --> 17:32.260
Bashame Meme!

17:32.600 --> 17:34.570
A sophomore apprentice,

17:34.570 --> 17:37.800
more than a human, less than a deer.

17:39.100 --> 17:41.250
<i>Why is she eating rice?</i>

17:42.220 --> 17:44.850
And looking forward to having my own rice field.

17:45.120 --> 17:46.140
Who are you talking to?

17:46.820 --> 17:49.990
I'm 3rd grader so I'm your senpai. Nice to meet you!

17:50.580 --> 17:52.070
Nice to meet you too!

17:52.890 --> 17:55.850
But Bashame been here longer than you.

17:55.970 --> 17:58.160
So don't get too ahead of yourself, OK?

18:00.070 --> 18:01.160
Okay…

18:01.660 --> 18:02.450
Got it.

18:02.760 --> 18:04.410
<i>When in Rome, do as the Romans do.</i>

18:04.710 --> 18:06.780
<i>In the deer club, do as the deer do.</i>

18:07.490 --> 18:09.040
And here's the 3rd deer,

18:09.520 --> 18:10.180
Anko!

18:10.870 --> 18:13.370
What gives you the right to call me a deer?

18:14.410 --> 18:15.990
But you want to be one…

18:16.380 --> 18:19.270
Only for my sister!

18:19.660 --> 18:22.150
I'm her personal deer!

18:22.650 --> 18:25.860
Erm, you're the sister of the student council president?

18:26.140 --> 18:27.150
Yes…

18:27.830 --> 18:29.850
And you're her personal deer?

18:30.310 --> 18:31.750
As I said.

18:32.360 --> 18:33.400
Any problem?

18:35.030 --> 18:37.070
No, none at all…

18:37.700 --> 18:38.530
Actually…

18:39.800 --> 18:41.960
Let's start the ex-deer-cises!

18:43.300 --> 18:44.050
First…

18:44.800 --> 18:45.250
Here!

18:48.410 --> 18:49.330
Uh…

18:50.040 --> 18:52.670
Are these deer crackers?

18:53.360 --> 18:54.210
What am I supposed to do?

18:57.370 --> 18:59.420
Ow! What's wrong with you?

18:59.790 --> 19:00.730
Shikayamada!

19:01.300 --> 19:03.190
And you say you want to become a deer?

19:03.690 --> 19:05.770
I'm sorry, but,

19:05.970 --> 19:09.660
you didn't give me any instructions…

19:10.550 --> 19:12.610
Bashame, show her the example

19:12.910 --> 19:14.150
as her senpai.

19:18.310 --> 19:22.120
When a deer sees a deer cracker, it gobbles it up immediately.

19:22.370 --> 19:23.450
It's basic.

19:24.270 --> 19:26.700
This ex-deer-cise sharpens your reflexes.

19:27.110 --> 19:29.580
Go for it like your life depends on it.

19:30.330 --> 19:31.210
Yes, ma'am…

19:31.500 --> 19:34.710
<i>Neko prayed that her life would never depend on it.</i>

19:35.450 --> 19:36.550
Your turn, Anko!

19:37.190 --> 19:40.000
I only eat what Torako gives me.

19:40.410 --> 19:42.590
By the way, where is she?

19:43.130 --> 19:46.600
Koshi-tan with the homeroom teacher, so she might not come.

19:46.900 --> 19:48.780
You could've said that earlier!

19:49.110 --> 19:51.770
I'll be able to sneak into her room!

19:52.170 --> 19:54.070
And do whatever I want

19:54.270 --> 19:56.180
in her sanctuary!

19:54.270 --> 19:56.270
DEER CLUB

19:57.370 --> 19:59.150
<i>She's skipping the club?</i>

19:59.570 --> 20:00.650
What nerve!

20:01.350 --> 20:03.450
- Time for antler-training!
- What?

20:04.150 --> 20:07.290
A deer must know how to grow its antlers!

20:07.630 --> 20:08.740
Like this!

20:08.920 --> 20:11.500
No normal deer can do that!

20:11.850 --> 20:15.640
Nokotan-senpai! It's too early for a beginner!

20:15.970 --> 20:17.890
<i>You too just joined!</i>

20:18.450 --> 20:21.010
Bashame, I understand your frustration.

20:21.480 --> 20:24.140
But I knew it from the first glance.

20:25.450 --> 20:26.350
This girl…

20:27.180 --> 20:29.640
She has deer talent.

20:31.370 --> 20:32.540
Let's get to work!

20:33.640 --> 20:34.360
Alright!

20:36.130 --> 20:38.280
Close your eyes and imagine…

20:39.240 --> 20:41.000
Imagine antlers growing.

20:41.770 --> 20:43.080
Antlers growing?

20:43.490 --> 20:45.270
Yes! Relax…

20:45.670 --> 20:49.240
<i>Antlers growing… Antlers growing…</i>

20:55.410 --> 20:57.690
Did your antlers just grow?

20:58.760 --> 21:00.210
But she's a beginner!

21:00.760 --> 21:04.050
Well done, Shikayamada! Your talent amazes me!

21:04.360 --> 21:05.560
Did I do it?

21:05.900 --> 21:09.010
I've never seen such power!

21:10.430 --> 21:11.510
I envy you!

21:12.430 --> 21:16.070
<i>So I really have the gift of the cervine?</i>

21:16.640 --> 21:19.800
<i>Like Koshi-tan, Neko is terribly gullible.</i>

21:21.190 --> 21:22.730
We've worked hard!

21:23.400 --> 21:25.270
I'm proud of you, Shikayamada.

21:26.540 --> 21:29.180
As a reward, I give you this. Congratulations.

21:29.900 --> 21:31.540
You've become a great deer!

21:32.250 --> 21:33.040
Master!

21:33.510 --> 21:35.970
I bow to you, you're a fine deer.

21:39.230 --> 21:42.380
I did it! Long live the deer club!

21:49.930 --> 21:53.620
But I haven't discovered Koshi Torako's weakness!

21:55.560 --> 21:57.880
NYAAAAAAA!

21:57.880 --> 21:58.870
<i>Hang in there, Neko!</i>

21:59.300 --> 22:02.190
<i>This experience might be useful to you one day,</i>

22:02.470 --> 22:03.680
<i>or maybe not!</i>

